---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import TimeLineElement from "../components/cv/TimeLine.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Resume" sideBarActiveItemID="cv">
  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Profile</div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-10 text-justify">
    I am a technical professional with an academic background in computational physics and applied machine learning,
    currently focused on leading complex projects from idea to delivery. My strengths are cross-functional
    coordination, translating ambiguity into actionable plans, and keeping teams aligned on priorities, timeline, and
    outcomes.
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Management Focus</div>
  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
    <li>Project planning and execution in research and innovation contexts</li>
    <li>Task decomposition, prioritization, and progress tracking across teams</li>
    <li>Stakeholder communication with technical and non-technical audiences</li>
    <li>Data-driven decision making and iterative problem solving</li>
    <li>Technical mentoring and teaching in classroom and lab environments</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Professional Experience</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Industrial AI Challenge 2023 - Team Supervisor"
      subtitle="2023 | Adige / BLM Group with Hub Innovazione Trentino"
    >
      During a timespan of 11 weeks, our team collaborated with BLM Group company, the parent firm of Adige SpA, to
      develop an AI planner. The model can analyze sales trends and serves as a central point for manufacturing
      workflow decision-making. I was responsible for data preprocessing and team supervision, including task tracking
      and communication with company stakeholders and the organization committee.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Tutor and Teaching Assistant"
      subtitle="Sep 2019 to present | University of Trento"
    >
      In the in-class courses, my task as a tutor was to prepare ad-hoc exercises beforehand and then follow students
      in their reasoning by providing hints and guidance toward the solution. In laboratory courses, our job was to
      explain lab experiences and assist students in data collection and analysis, ensuring that they understood the
      underlying reasoning and scientific approach.
      <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mt-2">
        <li>Feb 2025 - Sep 2025: Scientific Programming (teacher assistant, DF)</li>
        <li>Feb 2024 - Sep 2024: Scientific Programming (teacher assistant, DF)</li>
        <li>Sep 2022 - Dec 2022: Introductory Physics Laboratory, Mathematical Basis for Cognitive Sciences, Mathematics and Statistics I</li>
        <li>Mar 2022 - Jun 2022: Laboratory of Physics I with Matlab, Introductory Physics Laboratory</li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Founding Member - Progetto Apollo"
      subtitle="2017 to 2022 | University of Trento / Arditodesio"
    >
      Progetto Apollo is a scientific divulgation group operating at the University of Trento in collaboration with
      Arditodesio. Activities include research on key topics and interviews with university professors to produce
      narratives based on storytelling principles.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Junior Scientist Internship - Fondazione Bruno Kessler"
      subtitle="Jul 2015 | Trento, Italy"
    >
      The task of our two-student team was to study the effects of different NaCl concentrations on the contact angle
      between water droplets and various substrates (Borosilicate, Aluminium, and Soda-Lime Glass). The analysis was
      conducted both in static and dynamic regimes, and the experience concluded with a presentation during Notte dei
      Ricercatori 2015.
    </TimeLineElement>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Training and Certifications</div>
  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
    <li>
      <a href="https://www.trentinoinnovation.eu/industrial-ai-challenge-vince-il-team-al-lavoro-con-adige-spa-blm-group/" target="_blank"
        >Winner - Industrial AI Challenge 2023 (Adige / BLM Group and HIT)</a
      >
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="https://cyberchallenge.it/" target="_blank">CyberChallenge.IT (University of Trento and CINI)</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="https://webmagazine.unitn.it/evento/ateneo/69296/samsung-innovation-camp" target="_blank"
        >Innovation Camp Diploma (University of Trento in partnership with Samsung)</a
      >
    </li>
  </ul>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Technical Background (Selected)</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container grid gap-4 mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="PhD Student in Statistical and Biological Physics"
      subtitle="Nov 2023 to present | University of Trento"
    >
      Research on computational and machine learning approaches for complex biological systems.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Master's Degree in Physics"
      subtitle="Sep 2020 to Mar 2023 | University of Trento"
    >
      Final grade: 110/110. Strong training in computational modeling and data analysis.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Bachelor's Degree in Physics"
      subtitle="Sep 2016 to Mar 2020 | University of Trento"
    >
      Final grade: 94/110. Foundation in quantitative methods and scientific problem solving.
    </TimeLineElement>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Talks</div>
  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
    <li>
      <a href="https://sbp.physics.unitn.it/statistical-physics-of-living-systems-workshop" target="_blank"
        >Speaker - Statistical Physics of Living Systems Workshop (2023)</a
      >
    </li>
  </ul>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Languages</div>
  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
    <li>Italian - Native speaker</li>
    <li>English - Fluent (C1)</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Skills</div>
  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc md:columns-3 columns-2 mx-6">
    <li>Python (advanced)</li>
    <li>C (intermediate)</li>
    <li>LAMMPS (intermediate)</li>
    <li>NumPy and SciPy</li>
    <li>Pandas and scikit-learn</li>
    <li>PyTorch</li>
    <li>Matplotlib and Jupyter</li>
    <li>Quarto</li>
    <li>OpenCV and Tesseract tooling</li>
    <li>Machine Learning</li>
    <li>Scientific Computing</li>
    <li>Data Analysis</li>
    <li>Physics Modeling</li>
    <li>FPGA basics</li>
  </ul>
</BaseLayout>
